  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add diced onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add smoked chicken and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add curry powder, coriander, and cumin, and cook for 1-2 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "Pour in coconut milk and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and let cook for 10-15 minutes, or until chicken is cooked through.",
    "Season with fish sauce and salt to taste.",
